    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d611">

                <pb facs="0658" n="554" xml:id="pg554"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 868.001 G 29/7.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Minister to the
                            Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Athens</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1913-03-25">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">March 25, 1913</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The Ministers have been invited to be present at the reception of the King’s body
                    at the Piraeus March 26, 3 p.m. The funeral will take place on April second.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Schurman</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
